### 4.2 节点构建

```
每个 .md 文件 → 1 个 Node
  id         = frontmatter.id
  type       = frontmatter.object_type
  status     = frontmatter.status
  confidence = frontmatter.confidence
  summary    = frontmatter.summary
  owner      = frontmatter.owner
  file       = 相对路径
  depends    = frontmatter.depends || []
```

